2026-10-02T16:16:41.6318893Z # Fail-closed, on the paths-file step's own principle: a derivation
2026-10-02T16:16:41.6319287Z # that fails must fail the step, because an empty red list read from
2026-10-02T16:16:41.6319659Z # a failed fetch is "no reds" -- the fail-open this wiring closes.
2026-10-02T16:16:41.6319952Z gh api --paginate \
